<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> skos:scopeNote "Use for coordinate references and geolocation metadata. Declare units, reference frame and pixel conventions explicitly; metadata validation does not execute coordinate transformations."@en .
asref:CRSShape rdfs:label "CRSShape"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> ;
    skos:definition "Applies to instances of asref:CoordinateReferenceSystem; objects of asref:groundControlPointCRS, asref:hasCRS. Each focus node is a resource (an IRI or a blank node). asref:coordinateEpoch takes at most one value; each is an xsd:decimal literal. asref:crsIdentifier takes at most one value; each is an IRI. asref:wktString takes at most one value; each is an xsd:string literal at least 1 character long."@en .
asref:CoefficientVectorShape rdfs:label "Coefficient Vector Shape"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> ;
    skos:definition "Applied through references from other shapes. A conforming value is a resource (an IRI or a blank node). Each member of the list is a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. A coefficient vector must be a well-formed finite RDF list of exactly 20 cells."@en .
asref:CoordinateReferenceSystem skos:definition "A resource describing the coordinate system and reference frame in which spatial coordinates are interpreted."@en .
asref:CubicRationalTransformShape rdfs:label "Cubic Rational Transform Shape"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> ;
    skos:definition "Applies to instances of asref:CubicRationalTransform; objects of asref:hasRationalTransform. Each focus node is a resource (an IRI or a blank node). asref:heightOffset takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:heightScale takes exactly one value, a number greater than 0, conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:latitudeOffset takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:latitudeScale takes exactly one value, a number greater than 0, conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:lineDenominator takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:CoefficientVectorShape. asref:lineNumerator takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:CoefficientVectorShape. asref:lineOffset takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:lineScale takes exactly one value, a number greater than 0, conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:longitudeOffset takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:longitudeScale takes exactly one value, a number greater than 0, conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:polynomialBasis takes exactly one value, an IRI. asref:sampleDenominator takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:CoefficientVectorShape. asref:sampleNumerator takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:CoefficientVectorShape. asref:sampleOffset takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:sampleScale takes exactly one value, a number greater than 0, conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape."@en .
asref:FiniteDoubleShape rdfs:label "Finite Double Shape"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> ;
    skos:definition "Applied through references from other shapes. A conforming value is an xsd:double literal greater than -inf, less than inf, not a value matching the regular expression ^(nan|[+-]?inf)$ (flags \"i\")."@en .
asref:FloatValueShape skos:definition "Applied through references from other shapes. A conforming value is an xsd:double or xsd:float literal."@en .
asref:GeoTransformShape rdfs:label "Geo Transform Shape"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> ;
    skos:definition "Applies to instances of asref:GeoTransform; objects of asref:hasGeoTransform. Each focus node is a resource (an IRI or a blank node). asref:originX takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:originY takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:scaleX takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:scaleY takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:skewX takes at most one value; each is a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:skewY takes at most one value; each is a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape."@en .
asref:GroundControlPointShape rdfs:label "Ground Control Point Shape"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> ;
    skos:definition "Applies to instances of asref:GroundControlPoint; objects of asref:hasGroundControlPoint. asref:gcpIdentifier takes at most one value; each is an xsd:string literal. asref:gcpPixelX takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:gcpPixelY takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:gcpX takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:gcpY takes exactly one value, a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape. asref:gcpZ takes at most one value; each is a value conforming to asref:FiniteDoubleShape."@en .
asref:IntegerValueShape skos:definition "Applied through references from other shapes. A conforming value is an integer (of any XSD integer datatype)."@en .
asref:PixelCenter rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> ;
    skos:definition "Registration of a cell's value at the centre of its cell (a point sample, such as an elevation post). It does not move the grid: the normalized affine stays corner-based, and a source whose native transform is centre-based is shifted by half a cell when it is normalized, once, at lifting time."@en .
asref:PixelCorner rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/spatialref> ;
    skos:definition "Registration of a cell's value at, or as an area from, the cell's upper-left corner. The normalized affine is corner-based whatever the registration: column/row (0, 0) is the outer corner of the first cell."@en .
